{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist **split image and content section for Soluna**, closely inspired by the attached reference image.
    
    IMPORTANT: Create this as **one single Shopify section** and make it fully responsive.
    
    ## OVERALL LAYOUT
    
    Create a two-column layout on desktop.
    
    One side contains the text content and the other side contains a large lifestyle image.
    
    The layout should feel balanced, spacious and editorial, suitable for a luxury wellness brand.
    
    ### CONTENT COLUMN
    
    Include the following editable elements:
    
    **Eyebrow text**
    
    A small, refined eyebrow above the heading.
    
    **Main heading**
    
    A large, prominent heading.
    
    **Supporting text**
    
    A paragraph beneath the heading.
    
    **Button**
    
    A primary CTA button beneath the supporting text.
    
    All four elements must be editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    Allow separate spacing controls between each element.
    
    ---
    
    ## IMAGE COLUMN
    
    Add an editable Shopify image picker.
    
    The image should be large and visually prominent, similar to the supplied reference.
    
    Allow the merchant to:
    
    * Upload/change the image
    * Choose image position: Left / Right
    * Choose image fit: Cover / Contain
    * Adjust image height
    * Adjust image width
    * Adjust image border radius
    
    The image should maintain its aspect ratio and must not appear distorted.
    
    ---
    
    # IMAGE POSITION
    
    IMPORTANT:
    
    Add a Theme Editor setting called:
    
    **Image Position**
    
    Options:
    
    * Left
    * Right
    
    When **Right** is selected:
    
    TEXT | IMAGE
    
    When **Left** is selected:
    
    IMAGE | TEXT
    
    The entire layout should automatically reverse while maintaining the same spacing, proportions and visual hierarchy.
    
    ---
    
    # DESKTOP TEXT ALIGNMENT
    
    Add a Theme Editor setting for the desktop content alignment.
    
    Options:
    
    * Left
    * Centre
    * Right
    
    This setting must control the alignment of:
    
    * Eyebrow
    * Heading
    * Supporting text
    * Button
    
    The text and button should remain grouped together and aligned consistently.
    
    ---
    
    # MOBILE TEXT ALIGNMENT
    
    IMPORTANT:
    
    On mobile, **everything must remain centre aligned regardless of the desktop alignment setting.**
    
    The mobile layout should always display:
    
    Eyebrow
    Heading
    Supporting text
    Button
    Image
    
    All content should be centred.
    
    Do not allow the desktop left/right alignment setting to override the mobile centre alignment.
    
    ---
    
    # MOBILE LAYOUT
    
    On mobile, stack the two columns vertically.
    
    Use this order:
    
    **1. Text content**
    
    Eyebrow
    Heading
    Supporting text
    Button
    
    **2. Image**
    
    The image should appear underneath the complete text content.
    
    Even when the desktop image position is set to Left, the mobile order should remain:
    
    **TEXT → IMAGE**
    
    Do not place the image beside the text on mobile.
    
    ---
    
    # BUTTON
    
    Create a premium primary CTA button.
    
    Allow Theme Editor controls for:
    
    * Button text
    * Button link
    * Button background colour
    * Button text colour
    * Button border colour
    * Button border width
    * Button border radius
    * Button width
    * Button height
    * Button padding
    * Hover background colour
    * Hover text colour
    
    IMPORTANT:
    
    The **button border radius must be fully adjustable**.
    
    Allow the merchant to create:
    
    * Square corners
    * Slightly rounded corners
    * Rounded corners
    * Fully pill-shaped button
    
    The button should have a subtle hover transition.
    
    ---
    
    # IMAGE
    
    Allow complete control over the image styling:
    
    * Image picker
    * Image position
    * Image height
    * Image width
    * Image fit
    * Image focal position
    * Image border radius
    
    IMPORTANT:
    
    The **image border radius must be independently adjustable**.
    
    Allow:
    
    * 0px square corners
    * Slight rounding
    * Medium rounding
    * Large rounding
    * Fully rounded appearance
    
    The image should not automatically become circular.
    
    ---
    
    # SECTION SETTINGS
    
    Add Theme Editor controls for:
    
    ### Layout
    
    * Image position
    * Desktop column ratio
    * Column gap
    * Section max width
    * Content vertical alignment
    
    ### Spacing
    
    * Desktop top padding
    * Desktop bottom padding
    * Mobile top padding
    * Mobile bottom padding
    * Content spacing
    * Image spacing
    
    ### Colours
    
    * Section background
    * Eyebrow colour
    * Heading colour
    * Body text colour
    
    ### Typography
    
    * Eyebrow size
    * Heading size
    * Body text size
    * Heading line height
    * Body line height
    
    ### Alignment
    
    Desktop:
    
    * Left
    * Centre
    * Right
    
    Mobile:
    
    **Always Centre**
    
    ---
    
    # RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    ### Desktop
    
    Use a balanced two-column layout similar to the supplied reference.
    
    The image and content should occupy approximately equal visual importance.
    
    The image should feel substantial rather than appearing as a small thumbnail.
    
    ### Tablet
    
    Reduce column gap and typography proportionally.
    
    Maintain the two-column layout where the available width allows it.
    
    ### Mobile
    
    Stack vertically:
    
    **TEXT → IMAGE**
    
    Centre align every text element and the button.
    
    The image should automatically scale to the available screen width.
    
    Do not allow horizontal overflow.
    
    Reduce typography and spacing appropriately for smaller screens.
    
    ---, Give me ability to have Eyebrow in Normal letters and not only capitalised, Give me access to change the font everywhere.
    In mobile mode, make it so that the image is at the top and the text section is at the bottom, Make sure that the button has the text in it in a single line and make the button expand as the text increases and the text in button does not gio to second line, Make the heading font like proper heading and the text like the text, Give it some epace between the texts and the button, Give me optioon to control the size of all the texts.
    Make the heading bigger in size, Make the theading not bold please, Give me access to control the colour of button details when hovered over, Make the supporting text box supporting for rich text, Make sure thre oimage is visible completely imn mobile and computer mode., Give me option to have image in the right or the left of the section and as well in mobile, give me option to have the image at the top or bottom, Give the image the effect of zooming out slowly once loaded.
{% enddoc %}
